  {
   "id": 12,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "Coverage map",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 31,
    "w": 16,
    "h": 12
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "| What | Copy at home | Copy off-site (pi-pcb) | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **VMs and containers** | NAS dumps, nightly (3 daily + 3 weekly) | Proxmox dumps, 1st and 15th (last 2) | Guests in no job are listed on the right |\n| **Home Assistant** | Its own backup to the NAS, nightly | Same backup copied to pi-pcb | The VM is also in the nightly NAS dump (not off-site) |\n| **Paperless documents, home folders** | NAS shares *Poss*, *homes* | Hyper Backup *nas_hq_set2*, daily, versioned | Not encrypted |\n| **Paperless export** | NAS *Poss/paperless/export* | Included with *Poss* | No schedule exists; last run by hand |\n| **MemoryVault** (family photos, videos) | NAS | Hyper Backup *nas_hq*, daily, plain copy | No old versions |\n| **Home Videos, Books** | NAS *Media* | Hyper Backup *nas_hq* | Rest of *Media* is not copied |\n| **FreePBX (pbx2), ChannelsDVR** | NAS *Backups* share, nightly | Copied by *nas_hq* with the *Backups* share | |\n| **Remote nodes** (pi-pcb, pi-pdx, vps-sjc, pbx2) | NAS *Backups/<node>*, nightly, encrypted | *nas_hq* copies the *Backups* share | Folders are new: first off-site copy not yet confirmed |\n| **Not backed up** | | | *Movies*, *TV Shows*, *Other* (about 7.6 TB, replaceable) \u00b7 shares *Public*, *Surveillance*, *Time Machine*, *Encypted* (in neither Hyper Backup task) |\n\nBoth off-site copies live on one disk at one site. Nothing is in the cloud, and nothing is immutable."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Guests in NO nightly NAS job",
   "description": "Running ones are a risk: nothing is copying them. Stopped ones may be intentional.",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 16,
    "y": 31,
    "w": 8,
    "h": 6
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "label_replace(pve_guest_info{template=\"0\"} * on(id) group_left() pve_up, \"vmid\", \"$1\", \"id\", \".*/(.*)\") unless on(vmid) rl_pve_backup_expected{storage=\"nas-pdx\"}",
     "refId": "A",
     "instant": true,
     "range": false,
     "format": "table"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "align": "auto",
      "cellOptions": {
       "type": "auto"
      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "State"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "value",
          "options": {
           "1": {
